---
layout: layouts/feature.njk
wide: true
playgroundCta: true
hideBreadcrumbs: true
title: Features | Shellui
description: "Shellui is the microfrontend shell around your iframe app: navigation, authentication, administration, storage, theme, language, chrome actions, static build, and optional Tauri."
heading: The shell around your app
lede: "Your application stays the product. It runs in an iframe, in the stack you already write. Shellui is the durable host: navigation, sign-in, admin, files, theme, language, and chrome. One config file describes that host. The CLI ships static files, an optional preview on shellui.app, or a Tauri desktop app."
---

<div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.1fr)_minmax(0,0.9fr)] lg:gap-16">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty text-foreground sm:text-3xl">You keep the product. The host keeps the chrome.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Enterprise teams, startups, and solo developers use the same split. The iframe is yours. Shared surfaces live in <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-[0.8rem]">@shellui/core</code>, the iframe reaches them with <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-[0.8rem]">@shellui/sdk</code>, and <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-[0.8rem]">@shellui/cli</code> scaffolds the project.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Each page states the benefit, then how the host does it, then the docs.</p>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
      <a href="/architecture/" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary">Architecture</a>
      ·
      <a href="{{ site.docs }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary">Docs</a>
      ·
      <a href="{{ site.playground }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Playground</a>
      ·
      <a href="/changelog/" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary">Changelog</a>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    {% include "feature-visual-shell.njk" %}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3">
  {% for item in featurePages %}
    <a
      id="{{ item.id }}"
      href="{{ item.href }}"
      class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-card focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary"
    >
      <div class="border-b border-border bg-muted p-4 sm:p-5">
        <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[16rem] {% if item.visual == 'auth' %}max-w-[13rem]{% endif %}">
          {% if item.visual == "shell-layout" %}
            {% include "shell-layout-anim.njk" %}
          {% elif item.visual == "auth" %}
            {% include "feature-visual-auth.njk" %}
          {% elif item.visual == "admin" %}
            {% include "feature-visual-admin.njk" %}
          {% elif item.visual == "storage" %}
            {% include "feature-visual-storage.njk" %}
          {% elif item.visual == "chrome" %}
            {% include "feature-visual-chrome.njk" %}
          {% elif item.visual == "ship" %}
            {% include "feature-visual-ship.njk" %}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          {% set slotKind = "icon" %}
          {% set slotLabel = item.iconLabel %}
          {% set slotHint = "SVG · 1:1" %}
          {% set slotRatio = "square" %}
          {% include "media-slot.njk" %}
          <h2 class="min-w-0 pt-1 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty text-foreground">{{ item.title }}</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">{{ item.benefit }}</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          {% for point in item.points %}
            <li>{{ point }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary-ink group-hover:underline dark:text-primary">{{ item.cta }}</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
